  "annotation_protocol": "evaluation/annotation-layout.json + evaluation/annotation.py; all content local and hash-frozen, replayed by evaluation/rebuild.py. Freeze before heldout extraction. See limitations for annotation and sampling scope.",
  "limitations": [
    "Source-assisted agent annotations, not independent human or double annotations. All selected grid slots including blanks transcribed; layouts and full transcriptions inspected before any heldout extraction. Remaining annotation error is possible.",
    "PDFium native glyphs assist reference transcription and also support production checks, so check-usefulness evidence is correlated with that source decoder.",
    "English digital financial statements from four technology companies, two reports per company, five selected table regions per report; curated, correlated and not representative of all business reports.",
    "Company and report families are split disjointly; model pretrained exposure is unknown and this is not an established unseen-pretraining benchmark.",
    "Geometry is glyph-envelope precision for nonblank reference cells; blank positions have only table precision and do not enter geometry denominators.",
    "Whitespace is normalized only. Authored signs, currency, footnotes, digits, punctuation and units remain literal. Dot leaders are alignment decoration and omitted; broken U+FFFE mappings in audited hyphens are transcribed as hyphens.",
    "Unit metadata records scale captions, not every surrounding explanatory footnote; cell footnote markers are preserved. Entire report accuracy is not measured.",
    "Invisible OCR text is omitted only for independent Intel reference transcription. The extractor and production checks receive original unchanged files.",
    "IBM equity case is the complete upper yearly table on a page with two separate tables, not the entire equity statement spanning years."
  ],
